sequenceDiagram
  actor User as Usuario
  participant View as View Django
  participant Service as FinanceService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  User->>View: POST confirmar pagamento
  View->>Service: dados validados + permissao
  Service->>DB: BEGIN / lock / idempotencia
  Service->>DB: TransactionBatch + pernas
  DB-->>Service: COMMIT
  Service-->>User: sucesso e novo saldo
  User->>View: POST estornar
  View->>Service: solicitar reversao
  Service->>DB: novo batch com reversal_of
